'''Korthor''' is an undead [[Online:Dragon Priest|dragon priest]] found in [[Online:Vuldngrav|Vuldngrav]]. He holds {{Item Link|The Fork of Horripilation|questid=3725}}, an item needed for the related quest.
{{NewLeft}}

==Related Quests==
*{{Quest Link|Simply Misplaced}}

==Skills and Abilities==
;Entropic Bolt:A basic ranged attack dealing minor [[ON:Magic Damage|magic damage]].
;Summon Abomination:The enemy summons a [[ON:Flesh Atronach|flesh atronach]], [[ON:Bone Colossus|bone colossus]] or [[ON:Ghost|ghost]] to fight, spawning with the summoner's current {{ESO Health Link}}. The Bonelord's {{ESO Resistance Link|Physical|||y}} and {{ESO Resistance Link|Spell}} are reduced to 0 while a summon is active as seen by a blue glow on them. The summon automatically dies if the Bonelord is killed.
;Bone Cage:The Bonelord casts a rune on the ground that activates after a while, dealing low magic damage and [[Online:Combat#Root|rooting]] targets who step in it. This can be [[Online:Interrupt|interrupted]] to knock the Bonelord off balance. This cannot be blocked.
;Run Away!:When too close to them, the bonelord backs up to put some distance between their target and themselves.
;Bone Surge:The Bonelord casts a [[ON:Bone Shield|Bone Shield]]-like ability on themselves which reduces their melee damage taken by 20% until this disappears.

==Quest-Related Events==
During the quest, Haskill will send you to Vuldngrav to recover Sheogorath's missing artifact, {{Item Link|The Fork of Horripilation|questid=3725}}.
Examine the chest, which seems to rouse the Dragon Priest:
:'''Korthor:''' ''"You dare steal from me? Krif voth ahkrin!"''
:'''Arch-Mage Shalidor:''' ''"Ah. Korthor's awake."''
:'''Korthor:''' ''"My priests will make quick work of you! Luft Dinokii!"''

After you defeat his minions, he'll decry:
:'''Korthor:''' ''"Worthless!"''
:'''Korthor:''' ''"No matter. Come. Face me yourselves!"''

Enter his presence and he'll remark:
:'''Korthor:''' ''"Ahh … there you are."''

When combat begins:
:'''Korthor:''' ''"The Fork is mine! You shall not have it! Dir Nu!"''

